<hgroup><h1>Involvement of EupR, a response regulator of the NarL/FixJ family, in the control of the uptake of the compatible solutes ectoines by the halophilic bacterium <em>Chromohalobacter salexigens</em>
</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Rodr%C3%ADguez-Moya%20J"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Javier Rodríguez-Moya</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
