<sup>1</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Nieto%20JJ"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id4"><span class="name western">Joaquín J Nieto</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id4">
<h3><span class="name western">Joaquín J Nieto</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>1</sup>Department of Microbiology and Parasitology, Faculty of Pharmacy, University of Seville, Seville, Spain</div>
