<sup>3,</sup><sup>4</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Vargas%20C"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id7"><span class="name western">Carmen Vargas</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id7">
<h3><span class="name western">Carmen Vargas</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>1</sup>Department of Microbiology and Parasitology, Faculty of Pharmacy, University of Seville, Seville, Spain</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Vargas%20C"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Carmen Vargas</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1,</sup><sup>✉</sup>
</div>
<ul class="d-buttons inline-list">
<li><button class="d-button" aria-controls="aip_a" aria-expanded="false">Author information</button></li>
