</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1"> pJQMntR</td>
<td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">5-kb <em>Xba</em>I-<em>Apa</em>I fragment from pΩMntR (containing <em>orf1, eupR, mntR</em>::Ω, <em>orf4</em>) cloned into pJQ200-SK; Gm<sup>r </sup>Sm<sup>r </sup>Sp<sup>r</sup>
